    "created_at": "2020-06-23T18:30:57Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-06-23T18:31:04Z",
    "body": "I'd suggest authors package up custom data they want to transfer alongside their `Error`s, `Map`s, or `Set`s into an object, and structured clone that. E.g. `{ error: error, customData: \"foo\" }`.\r\n\r\nOtherwise, I think it would be neat to improve structured cloning and make it extensible, but that's hard problem. You can see some previous attempts at https://github.com/littledan/serializable-objects",
