    "body": "Since we cannot preserve subclasses across realms (unless the custom serializability proposal happens), the example you quote would not work as expected even if we did preserve the name. In particular, causing `.name` to get out of sync with `.constructor`/`.prototype` (including `.constructor.name` and `.prototype.name`) is much worse than just following the behavior of `Set` and `Map`.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
